      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running header in the block-centre margin: Han System Survey, Fascicle 9 (Yajima, Yamagami). This is provenance for the leaf and names the two domains whose maru-markers appear on it; it does not name Yagyū, whose closing line also prints here."
