  {
    "id": "anno-yajima_lower_p206_left-07",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "少參事　一人（五人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "少参事 一人（五人）／しょうさんじ いちにん（ごにん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Junior councillor (shōsanji). The office column prints 一人 (1 person) in full-size type, and a smaller 五人 (5 persons) is set immediately to its right, offset about 51 px right of the column centre and slightly higher. No parentheses are printed around the small figure — the parentheses in the transcription above are editorial, added so the two figures can be told apart in a flat string. (The comparable correction at Fukui, lower_p214_left 大參事 三人（四人）, does print its parentheses; this page does not.) The name count settles which figure is operative: five names follow — Satō Hikozaemon, Kasai Naoemon, Shiikawa Han'emon, Satō Tatewaki and Kagawa Yohachirō — so 五人 is the corrected figure and 一人 is the error it corrects."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "矢島藩少參事"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p206_left.jpg",
